### TuniPlan API — quick tests (Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code REST Client)
@host = https://localhost:7180
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Reference data
GET {{host}}/api/reference

### Register a client (DevCode is returned in Development)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountType": "Client",
  "firstName": "Amine",
  "lastName": "Ben Salah",
  "phoneNumber": "98 765 432",
  "email": "amine@example.com",
  "password": "MonMotDePasse2026"
}

### Verify the phone (use the devCode from the previous answer)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/verify-phone
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phoneNumber": "98765432", "code": "123456", "deviceName": "iPhone Amine" }

### Login with a demo account (password: TuniPlan#2026)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "kais@tuniplan.demo", "password": "TuniPlan#2026", "deviceName": "Postman" }

### Refresh
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "paste-refresh-token-here" }

### Search businesses
GET {{host}}/api/organizations?category=Beauty&governorate=Tunis&sort=rating

### Business page by slug
GET {{host}}/api/organizations/by-slug/maison-lilia

### My appointments
GET {{host}}/api/appointments?scope=upcoming
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### AI secretary
POST {{host}}/api/ai-secretary/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "organizationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "message": "nheb rdv ghodwa l3chiya" }
